CATEGORIES:Social
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\nJoin us for a day of deception\, trecheory\, and bac
 kstabbing as players compete to root out the traitors and survive banishm
 ents. Based on the hit reality-TV series "The Traitors"\, Contestants wil
 l begin by having 2-4 of them selected to titular Traitors. During the da
 y\, players will strategize and possibly compete in challenges for safety
 \, where each day will end with a roundtable vote. The player with the mo
 st votes will be eliminated from the game and must reveal once and for al
 l what team they belong to. During the night\, the traitors will secretly
  meet and "Murder" one contestant\, eliminating them for the game.\nIn th
 e end\, only one team can win. Think you have what it takes to win? Sign 
 up for The Traitors today\nhttps://forms.gle/ZHFsSjBvRMys7Poj6\n\n\n\n\n\
 n\nHosted by: Live Reality Games @ IU\n\nAdditional Information can be fo
 und at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12575221
DTEND:20260905T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041536Z
DTSTART:20260905T150000Z
LOCATION:Global & International Studies\, GA 1128
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Traitors Game Night
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12575221
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12575221
X-HOSTS:Live Reality Games @ IU
END:VEVENT
