DESCRIPTION:The Last Wine Conference marks our first major gathering of th
 e academic year at Indiana University Bloomington—a powerful call to rene
 wal\, awakening\, and deeper intimacy with God. This conference is design
 ed for those who are hungry for a fresh move of the Holy Spirit\, seeking
  revival\, and desiring to walk more closely with the Lord. Come expectin
 g worship\, impartation\, and transformation as we pursue the “New Wine” 
 God is pouring out in this season.\n\nHosted by: The Yadah Company\n\nAdd
 itional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event
 /12554237
DTEND:20260906T020000Z
