BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
CATEGORIES:Social
CATEGORIES:Leadership
DESCRIPTION:The Chinese Student and Scholar Association (CSSA) is requesti
 ng the reservation of one classroom on September 6\, 2026\, from 2:00 PM 
 to 5:30 PM for our annual Fall Officer Recruitment Interviews.\nThe class
 room will be used to conduct structured interviews with approximately 12 
 students applying for member positions within CSSA. Each candidate will b
 e assigned an individual interview time slot\, with approximately 20 minu
 tes allocated for each interview and additional transition time between c
 andidates. Candidates will arrive according to their scheduled time rathe
 r than gathering at the venue at the same time\, helping to minimize hall
 way traffic\, noise\, and disruption to other activities in the building.
 \nA quiet and organized classroom environment is important for allowing o
 ur current officers to conduct individual and panel interviews\, communic
 ate effectively with each candidate\, and maintain an orderly interview s
 chedule.\nThe event will not require any special room setup or modificati
 on to the classroom. CSSA will use the space responsibly and ensure that 
 all furniture and equipment remain in their original condition. The class
 room will be cleaned and restored to its original state immediately follo
 wing the conclusion of the interviews.\n\nHosted by: Chinese Students and
  Scholars Association\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://
 beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12680275
DTEND:20260906T213000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041536Z
DTSTART:20260906T180000Z
LOCATION:Global & International Studies\, GA 1100
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:2026 Fall Recruitment Interview
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12680275
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12680275
X-HOSTS:Chinese Students and Scholars Association
END:VEVENT
