 s\, corporate collaborations\, panels\, and interview prep.\nBy joining\,
  you'll tap into a national network of 13\,000+ members across 800+ schoo
 ls. With a 98% graduation rate and over 70% of upperclassmen landing inte
 rnships\, ColorStack gives you the tools and network you need to get hire
