 wn Hall\, a mandatory session designed specifically to protect your finan
 cial aid and level up your college experience.\nWhat’s in it for you:\n\n
 \nProtect Your Bag: Get crucial updates on financial aid changes before t
 hey impact your aid package.\n\n\nStay Ahead: Get clear guidance on what’
 s expected at this stage of your degree so there are no surprises.\n\n\nT
 ap Into Support: Discover exclusive resources\, campus perks\, and tools 
 built to keep you thriving.\n\n\nHave Your Say: This isn't just a present
 ation. Bring your questions\, real feedback\, and big ideas to help shape
  the future of the Groups program.\n\n\nYour presence matters. Your voice
  matters. Let's make this year count!\n\nHosted by: Groups Scholars Progr
 am\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.
 edu/event/12564153
