 g our performance\, we require access to the stage lights\, sound\, and p
 rojector. We need the space from 5pm-10pm because we need ample time to p
 ractice in the space before our performance which begins at 9pm.\n\n\nHos
 ted by: The University tWits Sketch Comedy Group\n\nAdditional Informatio
 n can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12583362
