 hematic and intimate four-day rotating involvement fair. Each day feature
 s a different theme and opportunites to get involved with organizations a
 nd activities. \nTuesday's Theme: The Creatives & Performers - Make Art\n
 Calling all creatives! Meet performing arts groups\, dance teams\, fine a
 rts organizations\, creative writing groups\, media groups\, and so many 
 more. Whether you love being on stage\, behind the scenes\, or creating s
 omething new\, there's a place for you to meet new collaborators!\n\nHost
 ed by: Student Involvement and Leadership Center\n\nAdditional Informatio
 n can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12589684
