DESCRIPTION:Be a joiner! Find your people and connect with others at our t
 hematic and intimate four-day rotating involvement fair. Each day feature
 s a different theme and opportunites to get involved with organizations a
 nd activities. \nThursday's Theme: The Hobbyists - Make Time for Fun and 
 Make Memories\nYour time on campus is more than just your classes! Whethe
 r you're looking to get active\, spend time ourdoors\, play a game\, or d
 ive into a new hobby\, this involvement fair day is all about making room
  for recreation and joy. Find your crew with intramural teams\, outdoor r
 ecreation groups\, and hobby activity groups!\n\nHosted by: Student Invol
 vement and Leadership Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: h
 ttps://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12590094
