X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging exploration of the history\, roots\, a
 nd lived experiences of Latine communities in Indiana with Nicole Martine
 z-LeGrand\, Multicultural Collections Curator in the Library and Archives
  division at the Indiana Historical Society.\nMartinez-LeGrand will share
  stories of the people\, families\, and communities who have shaped India
 na’s history\, highlighting their experiences\, contributions\, and endur
 ing legacies. Drawing from the Indiana Historical Society’s collections a
 nd her work documenting Indiana’s diverse communities\, she will illumina
 te the rich and often overlooked histories of Latine Hoosiers and the way
 s their stories are woven into the broader story of Indiana.\n\nHosted by
 : La Casa/Latino Cultural Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12575893
DTEND:20260924T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041536Z
