 s\, the Leadership Compass offers practical tools and meaningful conversa
 tions to elevate your leadership journey.\n📅 September 24th\, 2026⏰ 12:0
 0 PM – 2:00 PM📍 IMU Frangipani Room\nAll Indiana University events\, gro
 ups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observance
 s welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana University com
 munity.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union\, Student Involvement and Le
 adership Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvo
