DESCRIPTION:For this event\, students will have the opportunity to decorat
 e their own journal using a variety of craft materials. In addition to th
 e art aspect of decorating\, the event will review the benefits of journa
 ling as well as provide possible prompts for journaling. There are many b
 enefits of journaling for mental health and overall well-being. This will
  also educate students and allow them to learn more about the benefits of
  journaling. By having student decorate a journal\, it allows them to be 
 creative in their own way and express themselves.\nAll Indiana University
  events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historic
