DESCRIPTION:Join us for a night of free stand-up comedy and fun! \nLadies'
  Night Comedy is forum of comedians with the intention of advancing under
 represented voices in comedy and organizing evenings to showcase group an
 d individual talent through standup and sketch comedy. We are an inclusiv
 e environment that specializes in standup comedy to help members grow and
  foster their confidence and comedic prowess.\n\nHosted by: Ladies' Night
  Comedy\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.ind
 iana.edu/event/12582902
