DESCRIPTION:Looking for a free multi-course meal and a chance to improve y
 our dining etiquette? Then join FASE for this event!\nParticipants will h
 ave the opportunity to practice networking in a fine dining setting while
  gaining valuable insights. Key topics include dinner manners\, plate set
 tings\, and how to balance dining and networking effectively. And yes\, d
 essert is included!\nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\
 , and educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU 
 students and other members of the Indiana University community.\n\nHosted
  by: Mentoring Services and Leadership Development \n\nAdditional Informa
 tion can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12561925
