 tions to elevate your leadership journey.\n📅 October 29th\, 2026⏰ 12:00 
 PM – 2:00 PM📍 IMU Club Hub\nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, act
 ivities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome
