X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
CATEGORIES:Cultural
DESCRIPTION:Discover the rich flavors and cultural stories behind some bel
 oved Latine desserts in a series of cooking demonstrations that bring tim
 e-honored recipes to life. Each session highlights a different cultural t
 reat.\nWhether you’re looking to expand your culinary repertoire or recon
 nect with cherished flavors\, Sweet Traditions invites you to savor the s
 weetness of Latine heritages\, one dessert at a time.\n\nHosted by: La Ca
 sa/Latino Cultural Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: http
 s://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12504241
