CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
DESCRIPTION:We host educational workshops\, discussions\, community and so
 cial events\, and professional development events. Our educational worksh
 ops raise awareness of important current events. Discussions give all mem
 bers a chance to connect. Community events allow us to make a positive im
